# firewall-IA — Docker build context filter.
#
# ALLOWLIST on purpose. The repository root holds artifacts that must never enter
# an image build context: the V4 adapter (model-output*/, 157 MB, gitignored),
# csic_database.csv (28 MB), the historical train.jsonl/eval.jsonl (43 MB),
# datasets/, reports/ (frozen experiment records), .git/ and .venv-dataplane/.
# Denying them one by one is fragile, so everything is excluded and only what the
# images actually need is added back.
#
# If a service needs a new file from the repository root, re-include it here.

*

# Control plane image (docker/control-plane/Dockerfile).
!control_plane/
!requirements.txt

# Data plane image (docker/data-plane/Dockerfile).
!data_plane/
!requirements-data-plane.txt

# Never ship caches, even from the re-included directories above.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
